        <edge from="n8" to="n8">
            <attr name="label">
                <string>rem:Tests that the counter value is odd by dividing 1 by (value mod 2): in every even state the division by zero constructs an ErrorValue, which puts the cost of finding 4.2.3 on the path. The rule modifies nothing, so it adds a self-loop per odd state and leaves the state space unchanged.</string>
            </attr>
        </edge>
